{"id":"huile","lemma":"huile","pos":"noun","rank":2009,"glosses":["oil (liquid fat)","big gun, big cheese (person of consequence)"],"ipa":"/ɥil/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/Fr-huile.ogg/Fr-huile.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"huiles"},"formAudio":{"huiles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-huiles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je vérifie l'huile ?","en":"Shall I check the oil?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to check, to verify","l":"vérifier"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'aurais dû changer l'huile.","en":"I should've changed the oil.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334636","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to exchange"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Garde l'huile loin du feu.","en":"Keep oil away from the fire.","words":[{"g":"a watch, guard"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"far, distant"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"fire"}]},{"text":"Veuillez contrôler l'huile, je vous prie.","en":"Would you check the oil, please?","words":[{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to check or examine"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to pray","l":"prier"}]},{"text":"As-tu vérifié le niveau d'huile récemment ?","en":"Have you checked the oil level recently?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to check, to verify","l":"vérifier"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"level"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"recently"}]}]}